#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:2
msgid "Real-lens effects"
msgstr "真實鏡頭的效應"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:4
msgid ""
"The thin-lens model and the FOV formula match real lenses well near the "
"centre of the frame. Off-centre, three physical effects show up that the "
"sensor pipeline has to account for: straight lines in the scene curve on the"
" sensor, corner pixels record the scene dimmer than centre pixels, and the "
"rays converging onto each pixel arrive at an angle that depends on where the"
" pixel sits."
msgstr ""
"薄透鏡模型與 FOV "
"公式在影格中央附近與真實鏡頭吻合得很好。在偏離中心的位置，會出現三種感測器處理流程必須加以考量的物理效應：場景中的直線在感測器上會彎曲、角落像素記錄到的場景比中央像素更暗，以及匯聚到每個像素上的光線抵達的角度取決於該像素所在的位置。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:13
msgid "Barrel and pincushion distortion"
msgstr "桶狀與枕狀畸變"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:15
msgid ""
"The thin-lens model says straight lines in the scene project to straight "
"lines on the sensor. Real lenses bend off-axis rays slightly differently "
"from what the model predicts, and the result is that straight lines in the "
"scene curve gently on the sensor. The bending is *radial* -- lines passing "
"through the centre of the frame stay straight, but lines offset from the "
"centre bow outward or inward."
msgstr ""
"薄透鏡模型認為場景中的直線會投影成感測器上的直線。真實鏡頭使離軸光線彎折的方式與模型預測的略有不同，結果是場景中的直線在感測器上會輕微彎曲。這種彎曲是 "
"*徑向* 的——通過影格中心的線維持筆直，但偏離中心的線則會向外或向內彎曲。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:24
msgid ""
"Three panels showing the same square outline. The\n"
"left panel is an ideal undistorted square. The\n"
"middle panel shows barrel distortion: the square's\n"
"sides bulge outward. The right panel shows\n"
"pincushion distortion: the square's sides bow\n"
"inward toward the centre. In all three panels a\n"
"horizontal and a vertical line through the centre\n"
"stay straight."
msgstr ""
"三個面板顯示同一個正方形輪廓。左面板是理想的無畸變正方形。中間面板顯示桶狀畸變：正方形的各邊向外凸出。右面板顯示枕狀畸變：正方形的各邊朝中心向內彎曲。在三個面板中，通過中心的一條水平線與一條垂直線都維持筆直。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:34
msgid ""
"Left: an ideal frame. Middle: barrel distortion bulges the edges outward. "
"Right: pincushion distortion bows them inward."
msgstr "左：理想影格。中：桶狀畸變使邊緣向外凸出。右：枕狀畸變使邊緣向內彎曲。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:38
msgid "Two flavours of distortion show up in practice:"
msgstr "實務上會出現兩種畸變："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:40
msgid ""
"*Barrel* distortion bows lines outward from the centre, like the staves of a"
" barrel. Short focal lengths (wide-angle lenses) are the usual culprit, and "
"a fish-eye lens at the extreme is just severe barrel distortion."
msgstr "*桶狀* 畸變使線條從中心向外彎曲，像桶子的桶板一樣。短焦距（廣角鏡頭）通常是元兇，而極端情況下的魚眼鏡頭其實就是嚴重的桶狀畸變。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:44
msgid ""
"*Pincushion* distortion pinches lines inward toward the centre, like the "
"laces of a pincushion. Long focal lengths (telephoto lenses) tend to produce"
" it, usually more subtly than wide-angle barrel."
msgstr "*枕狀* 畸變使線條朝中心向內收縮，像針插上的縫線一樣。長焦距（望遠鏡頭）容易產生這種畸變，通常比廣角的桶狀畸變更細微。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:49
msgid ""
"Software can correct distortion after the fact, given a calibrated "
"description of how a particular lens deviates from the ideal. The fix is a "
"per-pixel coordinate remap from the distorted image back to where each ray "
"would have landed without the bending."
msgstr ""
"只要有針對特定鏡頭如何偏離理想情況所做的校正描述，軟體就能在事後修正畸變。修正的方式是針對每個像素，把失真影像重新映射回每條光線在沒有彎折情況下原本應落在的位置。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:56
msgid "Light falloff at the corners"
msgstr "角落的光量衰減"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:58
msgid ""
"A uniformly bright scene comes out brighter at the centre of the recorded "
"image than at the corners. Three geometric effects compound "
"multiplicatively. For a scene point at angle :math:`\\theta` from the "
"optical axis:"
msgstr "亮度均勻的場景，在記錄影像的中央會比角落更亮。三種幾何效應會以乘法方式疊加。對於相對於光軸成 :math:`\\theta` 角的場景點："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:63
msgid ""
"**1. The corner is farther from the lens than the centre.** A point at angle"
" :math:`\\theta` on the same scene plane sits at distance :math:`D / "
"\\cos\\theta` from the lens, against distance :math:`D` for the on-axis "
"point. The inverse-square law says intensity falls as the square of "
"distance, so on its own this effect contributes"
msgstr ""
"**1. 角落比中央離鏡頭更遠。** 在同一場景平面上、成 :math:`\\theta` 角的點，距鏡頭的距離為 :math:`D / "
"\\cos\\theta`\\ ，而在軸上的點距離則為 :math:`D`\\ "
"。平方反比定律指出光強度與距離平方成反比衰減，因此單就這項效應本身就貢獻了"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\frac{1}{(D / \\cos\\theta)^2} \\div \\frac{1}{D^2}\n"
"= \\cos^2\\theta"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{1}{(D / \\cos\\theta)^2} \\div \\frac{1}{D^2}\n"
"= \\cos^2\\theta"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:75
msgid "-- two factors of :math:`\\cos\\theta`."
msgstr "——兩個 :math:`\\cos\\theta` 因子。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:77
msgid ""
"**2. The lens aperture is foreshortened from the corner.** Seen from the "
"off-axis point, the aperture surface is tilted by angle :math:`\\theta` "
"relative to the line of sight. Its projected area, and so the amount of "
"light it collects, is reduced by :math:`\\cos\\theta`."
msgstr ""
"**2. 從角落看過去，鏡頭光圈會發生透視縮短。** 從離軸點看過去，光圈面相對於視線方向傾斜了 :math:`\\theta` "
"角。它的投影面積（也就是它所收集的光量）會減少 :math:`\\cos\\theta` 倍。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:83
msgid ""
"**3. The sensor receives the light at an angle.** Rays converging onto a "
"corner pixel hit the sensor at angle :math:`\\theta` from the normal. The "
"same light bundle spreads across a patch larger by :math:`1 / \\cos\\theta`,"
" so per-area intensity drops by :math:`\\cos\\theta`."
msgstr ""
"**3. 感測器以斜角接收光線。** 匯聚到角落像素上的光線以相對於法線 :math:`\\theta` 的角度打在感測器上。同一束光擴散到一塊大了 "
":math:`1 / \\cos\\theta` 倍的區域上，因此每單位面積的光強度下降 :math:`\\cos\\theta` 倍。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:89
msgid "The three effects multiply:"
msgstr "這三項效應相乘："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:91
msgid ""
"\\cos^2\\theta \\;\\cdot\\; \\cos\\theta \\;\\cdot\\; \\cos\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^4\\theta"
msgstr ""
"\\cos^2\\theta \\;\\cdot\\; \\cos\\theta \\;\\cdot\\; \\cos\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^4\\theta"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:96
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This is the *cos⁴ falloff*. For a wide-angle lens whose corner ray makes a "
"60° angle with the optical axis, :math:`\\cos^4 60° = 0.0625` -- the corner "
"records at about 6% of the brightness of the centre."
msgstr ""
"這就是 *cos⁴ 衰減*\\ 。對於角落光線與光軸夾 60° 角的廣角鏡頭，\\ :math:`\\cos^4 60° = 0.0625`\\ "
"——角落記錄到的亮度約為中央的 6%。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:101
msgid ""
"A rectangular frame filled with a radial gradient\n"
"that is bright in the centre and dim toward the\n"
"corners."
msgstr "一個矩形影格，填滿了徑向漸層，中央明亮而朝角落漸暗。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:106
msgid ""
"A uniformly lit scene comes out bright in the centre and dim at the corners,"
" falling off as :math:`\\cos^4(\\theta)` of the corner angle."
msgstr "亮度均勻的場景，呈現出中央明亮、角落昏暗的結果，並依角落角度的 :math:`\\cos^4(\\theta)` 衰減。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:110
msgid ""
"Mechanical *vignetting* from the lens housing -- light clipped by the rim of"
" the lens barrel or by the mount -- adds to the geometric falloff and looks "
"the same: darker corners. A common mitigation on the lens side is to pick a "
"lens whose image circle is substantially larger than the sensor diagonal: "
"the sensor then captures only the inner, better-corrected portion of the "
"lens's image, where the corner angle :math:`\\theta` is smaller and the "
":math:`\\cos^4` term is correspondingly less severe. The same choice helps "
"with barrel distortion and chief ray angle at the corners, since all three "
"effects worsen toward the edge of the image circle. Whatever falloff remains"
" is handled by the on-sensor *lens-shading correction* (LSC), covered in "
":doc:`on-sensor calibration <../sensor/calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"來自鏡頭外殼的機械式 *暗角*\\ "
"——被鏡筒邊緣或接環裁切掉的光線——會疊加在幾何衰減之上，看起來也一樣：角落較暗。在鏡頭端常見的緩解方式，是選用像圈明顯大於感測器對角線的鏡頭：如此一來感測器只擷取鏡頭影像中較內側、校正較佳的部分，該處的角落角度"
" :math:`\\theta` 較小，\\ :math:`\\cos^4` "
"項也因此較不嚴重。同樣的選擇也有助於改善角落的桶狀畸變與主光線角度，因為這三項效應都會朝像圈邊緣惡化。剩餘的任何衰減則由感測器上的 *鏡頭陰影校正*\\"
" （LSC）處理，詳見 :doc:`感測器上校正 <../sensor/calibration>`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:127
msgid "Chief ray angle"
msgstr "主光線角度"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:129
msgid ""
"A bundle of rays from a single scene point converges through the lens and "
"lands on a single sensor pixel. The central ray of that bundle -- the one "
"passing through the centre of the lens aperture -- is the *chief ray*. At "
"the centre of the sensor (the optical axis), the chief ray arrives "
"perpendicular to the sensor surface. At pixels away from the centre, the "
"chief ray arrives at an angle."
msgstr ""
"來自單一場景點的一束光線穿過鏡頭匯聚，落在單一感測器像素上。該光束的中心光線——也就是通過鏡頭光圈中心的那一條——就是 *主光線*\\ "
"。在感測器中央（光軸處），主光線垂直抵達感測器表面。在偏離中心的像素處，主光線則以斜角抵達。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:137
msgid ""
"A side view of a lens and a sensor with three\n"
"chief rays drawn from the centre of the lens to\n"
"three pixels on the sensor -- top, centre, and\n"
"bottom. The chief ray to the centre pixel is along\n"
"the optical axis and is perpendicular to the\n"
"sensor surface. The chief rays to the top and\n"
"bottom pixels arrive at the sensor at a slant. The\n"
"angle between the chief ray and the sensor normal\n"
"at the top pixel is labelled CRA."
msgstr ""
"鏡頭與感測器的側視圖，圖中畫有三條主光線，分別從鏡頭中心射向感測器上的三個像素——頂端、中央與底端。射向中央像素的主光線沿著光軸，並垂直於感測器表面。射向頂端與底端像素的主光線則以斜角抵達感測器。頂端像素處主光線與感測器法線之間的夾角標示為"
" CRA。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:148
msgid ""
"The chief ray for each pixel converges through the lens centre. The angle it"
" makes with the sensor normal is the chief ray angle (CRA), zero on the "
"optical axis and growing toward the corners."
msgstr "每個像素的主光線都穿過鏡頭中心匯聚。它與感測器法線所成的夾角就是主光線角度（CRA），在光軸處為零，並朝角落增大。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:153
msgid ""
"The angle between the chief ray and the sensor normal at a given pixel is "
"the *chief ray angle*, or CRA. CRA is zero at the centre of the sensor and "
"grows toward the corners. The maximum value depends on the lens design -- "
"common values for small fixed-lens cameras range from about 15° to 30° at "
"the corners."
msgstr ""
"在特定像素處，主光線與感測器法線之間的夾角就是 *主光線角度*\\ ，即 CRA。CRA "
"在感測器中央為零，並朝角落增大。其最大值取決於鏡頭設計——小型定焦鏡頭相機在角落的常見值約為 15° 到 30°。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/optics/real-lens-effects.rst:160
msgid ""
"CRA matters because sensor pixels respond best to light arriving close to "
"perpendicular to the sensor surface. At steep angles the response drops off,"
" and some of the light can leak between neighbouring pixels. Sensor designs "
"accommodate a specific CRA profile -- pairing a sensor with a lens whose "
"profile differs substantially shows up as visible sensitivity and colour "
"errors in the corners, which is why image sensors and lenses are usually "
"chosen together."
msgstr ""
"CRA "
"之所以重要，是因為感測器像素對接近垂直抵達感測器表面的光線反應最佳。在陡峭角度下反應會下降，且部分光線可能在相鄰像素之間外洩。感測器設計會配合特定的 "
"CRA 分佈——若將感測器與分佈差異甚大的鏡頭搭配，就會在角落出現明顯的靈敏度與色彩誤差，這也是為什麼影像感測器與鏡頭通常會一起挑選的原因。"
